{"1596220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tales of Arcrath", "steam_appid": 1596220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  AI images are optional in the game<br><br>Arcrath is a 2D JRPG series that pertains to historical eras such as Dark Ages, Ancient Rome, Feudal Japan etc...    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game consists of many features; however, the main functions are as follows</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20+ hours</strong> - Live your life in a World of Philosophy and Poetry</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Government: There is a government feature where the player manages towns such as shop development, taxes, commerce, food safety etc...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Field Warfare: There is a Field Warfare aspect integrated in with the traditional Side View Battle System whereas the town may get attacked by rebels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Naval Warfare: Sink pirate ships or merchants</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Multiple Parties: Player takes control of multiple parties pertaining to the current House they are playing as</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Simulation: The game has an AI to manage the town, Towns have their own Data such as population, coin, food and resources providing a simulator game experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and much more...<br><br><strong>Disclosure</strong>  <br>AI is used for the background images in the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I use it as a tool to assist in setting the tone/atmosphere of scenes</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  AI images are optional in the game<br><br>Arcrath is a 2D JRPG series that pertains to historical eras such as Dark Ages, Ancient Rome, Feudal Japan e